              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "متحف (matḥaf) is built on the native Arabic root t-ḥ-f, \"a rare gift\" (Lane). Matḥaf is a modern place noun built on tuḥfa, \"a rarity\": \"a place of rarities\"."
